        },
        {
          "text": "Paul, ebulesit loka Edeke, ekiyakia da loka Yesu Kristo aisilosikinia aiyuun naka luseuna luka Edeke ka ajenunikec naka abeit kiton ayoŋit Edeke, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
